{"1322780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unexpected Tasks", "steam_appid": 1322780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322780/extras/d2624e42ebccb534675d6c9ad93813a5.avif?t=1788078484\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave work behind, clear your mind, and enjoy a few quiet minutes with a <strong>Time Management</strong> adventure that's simple, satisfying, and easy to pick up. Play at your own pace, with or without a timer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322780/extras/d2fb403416eb4ac9ed8d7c4889a2bc31.avif?t=1788078484\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322780/extras/14af2852514fb5c23e7948a3e714cf53.poster.avif?t=1788078484\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322780/extras/14af2852514fb5c23e7948a3e714cf53.webm?t=1788078484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322780/extras/14af2852514fb5c23e7948a3e714cf53.mp4?t=1788078484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some days you just want to relax. Turn on <strong>Relax Mode</strong> and play without a timer. Feel like a challenge instead? Turn it back on and go for Gold.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master every level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to improve your time? The built-in guide includes both general gameplay tips and level-specific strategies, so you can always find a better solution without searching online.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfect for short play sessions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is designed to fit into a coffee break, a quiet evening, or any moment when you just want to switch off for a while.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322780/extras/51cb1ab85c1faaaa2f03ac414ec8edf0.avif?t=1788078484\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322780/extras/365ff79f223ac27a3b502171967904d2.poster.avif?t=1788078484\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322780/extras/365ff79f223ac27a3b502171967904d2.webm?t=1788078484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322780/extras/365ff79f223ac27a3b502171967904d2.mp4?t=1788078484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected Tasks</strong> continues the story of <strong>The Unexpected Quest</strong>. Join familiar heroes after their escape from the Necromancer's castle and discover what happens next in a brand-new Time Management adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to the series? Don't worry. This is a standalone story, and a great place to begin.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322780/extras/d2624e42ebccb534675d6c9ad93813a5.avif?t=1788078484\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave work behind, clear your mind, and enjoy a few quiet minutes with a <strong>Time Management</strong> adventure that's simple, satisfying, and easy to pick up. Pl